{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "c542f97c3eef179beed617114ce646c15189f2e6d62a121340a22d296696e17b", "ja": "本当ですか！？　嬉しいな～♪\nあ、でもそれは、カレーのおかげかもしれません！", "zh": "真的吗！？好开心啊～♪\n啊，不过那也可能是多亏了咖喱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c8b5bd21484806d968ff86a0f87bb0bfa40f4fc7283a51a711c74a56a63a8dc3", "ja": "カレーのおかげ？", "zh": "多亏了咖喱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "feac4350b553a36c724dd14a1ec656cfab4bcefd49145257416c2500ad2b8789", "ja": "昨日、お母さんがカレーを作ってくれたんです！\nなので、今日はカレーパワー満タンだったんですよ～。", "zh": "昨天，妈妈给我做了咖喱！\n所以今天咖喱的力量满满当当的哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1006_p", "source_sha256": "70f45195058acca51eba54f271ec9e907f87c69f5a009a5ec09f1f9317a6904b", "ja": "なるほど、モチベーションが最高だったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，你昨天的干劲特别足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "c660fbf7fe68c303b246799c9f581612dcf134c1d8a2a2882f71e28fd8f0b27a", "ja": "えへへ♪　カレーって、本当にすごい料理\nですよね～。おいしいし、毎日食べても飽きないし！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪咖喱真的是很棒的料理呢～既好吃，就算每天吃也不会腻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "59d1df09d4a817f264cf998852cf13fc525afb5bb6dd05590e3774428459e2ac", "ja": "作るのも難しくないですし！\nカレーが嫌いな人って、あんまり聞かないし。", "zh": "做起来也不难！\n而且我还没怎么听说有人讨厌咖喱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d9f69bd8f0b83b4381ab3e635e9c8833212b2a91bf82c87020fd58c57c8c6265", "ja": "確かにそうだな。\nカレーは国民食とか言われたりするもんな。", "zh": "说得也是。\n咖喱嘛，有时候还被称为国民美食呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "4b35f4fdce8ad5c513c937c13149d38b279ea12885c87748f9cd0404103021d3", "ja": "そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\n決めました！　私、カレーになりますっ！", "zh": "对了！{$P$}先生，我决定了！我要成为咖喱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bac76545fe24531e7821ed61020a954a0ab133e1081645452e190bede74166fa", "ja": "うん？　それは……どういう意味だ？", "zh": "嗯？那是……什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "7c0c81c5082ba119041899e2029abe777d247ef74f8389920f2dbac872dc880c", "ja": "みんなに愛されて、みんなを笑顔にできて、\nとっても身近で、でも毎日でも飽きない……。", "zh": "深受大家喜爱，能让所有人都绽放笑容，\n感觉特别亲切，而且就算天天吃也不会腻……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "0ccb55c4020cf5e9364597f8a371eacbcf5a1aabbfe49a4608a6041622f33d22", "ja": "私が目指してるアイドルって、そんな\nカレーみたいな存在なのかも、って思ったんです！", "zh": "我就在想，我所追求的偶像，说不定就是那种像咖喱一样的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a6740986f4d3fa801b9dac80c0958f48621813d9c65a45bc6c4d7a9e24523707", "ja": "おっ、いいんじゃないか？\n国民的なアイドルを目指す、ってわけだな。", "zh": "哦，不错嘛？\n也就是说，要以成为国民偶像为目标吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "61e98ebb80ce07f23ed7ffc0db87430021498341bef001625f2ca092a341f86c", "ja": "そうです！　ちょっとスパイシーで、\nみんなをトリコにしちゃうアイドルですよ！", "zh": "没错！就是要成为有点火辣、把大家都迷得神魂颠倒的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "485055a6113d1eeca408746acbc063d2df28f4e019c1c720adb4952b0859028f", "ja": "{$P$}さんはシェフです！\n私をおいしくしてくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生就是主厨！\n请把我也变得更加美味哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1017_p", "source_sha256": "eb83b67701b73dad8dd7f90444d396301cf7b9e22e953de50f3ac08273a4c163", "ja": "わかったよ。トップアイドルになるためのレシピ、\n頑張って考えるから。一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "知道了。为了成为顶级偶像的食谱，\n我会努力想出来的。我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0223_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "73a3f80d4cd2e78fe3ba1431c689bffd20921d3b4bd982d8ea84b6fd677fd0b7", "ja": "はーい！　明日の朝には、今日よりちょびっと\nおいしくなれるかな～？　えへへっ♪", "zh": "好——！到了明天早上，我能不能变得比今天稍微更出色一点呢～？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
